<h2 class="cond h2" style="margin: 0; line-height: 0.92; color: #1E2427">Start with the <span style="color: #283485">basics</span></h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; color: #626A70">Five short guides before your first time in the canoe.</p>
